{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15616","headline":"梅里旅夕 · 杨凌","name":"梅里旅夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沧洲东望路，旅櫂怆羁游。\n枫浦蝉随岸，沙汀鸥转流。\n露天星上月，水国夜生秋。\n谁忍持相忆，南归一叶舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨凌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}